title: Your refund for order [ORDER_NUMBER]
aria: Your refund for order [ORDER_NUMBER]
preheader: The money is already released. Your bank sets the day it lands on your statement.
subject: Your refund for order [ORDER_NUMBER]
footer: transactional
reason: You are receiving this email because a refund was issued on order [ORDER_NUMBER], placed with the [PRODUCT_NAME] account registered to [EMAIL_ADDRESS].
