--- text
Your refund has been sent

We have sent [CURRENCY] [REFUND_AMOUNT] back to [REFUND_METHOD] for
order [ORDER_NUMBER]. Nothing more is needed from you.

Refund details

Order number: [ORDER_NUMBER]
Refund amount: [CURRENCY] [REFUND_AMOUNT]
Refunded to: [REFUND_METHOD]
Expected within: [REFUND_DAYS]

Items refunded from order [ORDER_NUMBER]

Item: [ITEM_1_NAME]
[ITEM_1_VARIANT]
Qty: [ITEM_1_QTY]
Amount: [CURRENCY] [ITEM_1_AMOUNT]

Item: [ITEM_2_NAME]
[ITEM_2_VARIANT]
Qty: [ITEM_2_QTY]
Amount: [CURRENCY] [ITEM_2_AMOUNT]

Refund totals

Subtotal refunded: [CURRENCY] [SUBTOTAL]
Shipping refunded: [CURRENCY] [SHIPPING]
Tax refunded: [CURRENCY] [TAX]
Total refunded: [CURRENCY] [REFUND_AMOUNT]

[COMPANY_NAME] released the money as soon as the refund was
approved. From that point your bank or card issuer decides when it
appears on your statement, and that step is not ours to speed up.
It is why we give a range of days and not a single date.

View your order:

[ORDER_URL]

If the money has not reached [REFUND_METHOD] within
[REFUND_DAYS], ask your bank or card issuer to look for a pending
credit against order [ORDER_NUMBER]. If they have no record of it,
reply to this email and we will trace it.

If a line on this refund does not look right, reply to this email,
or write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
